Using the shops to identify/partially identify your stuff mainly comes
from the fact that you can make a very good guess as to the cost of
your items.  It's sort of 'price check' at the stores, and then, once
you know the value of your items, you can narrow the possibility of
some of the crap you are carrying, especially important is the value of
the scrolls.  This method leads you to pinpoint which scrolls are the
scrolls of identify, and then, once you obtain a pile of scrolls of
identify, you bless it with the holy water and you can actually start
identify everything else.

That's sort of the listos version of how to use the stores to identify
stuff.  There are a lot of other things you can guess from stores/other
things.  Reading some spoilers about identifying items very carefully
will give you a lot of details about the process, but the first step is
to get price check on your scrolls so you can find out which scrolls
are the scrolls of identify.  

